{"id":50217,"date":"2026-03-28T07:29:31","date_gmt":"2026-03-28T06:29:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-trail-serra-darga-2026\/"},"modified":"2026-09-04T16:44:05","modified_gmt":"2026-09-04T15:44:05","slug":"grande-trail-serra-darga","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/grande-trail-serra-darga\/","title":{"rendered":"Grande Trail Serra D\u2019Arga 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Grande Trail Serra D\u2019Arga 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Grande Trail da Serra d\u2019Arga 2026 (GTSA)<\/strong> realiza-se de <strong>2 a 4 de outubro de 2026<\/strong> na deslumbrante <strong>Serra d\u2019Arga<\/strong>, no Alto Minho. Considerado um dos eventos mais carism\u00e1ticos e m\u00edticos do trail running nacional, o evento liga a cidade de <strong>Viana do Castelo<\/strong> \u00e0 freguesia de <strong>Dem<\/strong>, no concelho de <strong>Caminha<\/strong>, e \u00e0s aldeias hist\u00f3ricas de S\u00e3o Louren\u00e7o da Montaria e Arga de Cima.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Carlos S\u00e1 Nature Events<\/strong>, o GTSA integra o circuito Best Trail Series e os Circuitos Nacionais da ATRP, com provas \u00e9picas de <strong>100 km (partida noturna)<\/strong>, <strong>50 km (2500m D+)<\/strong>, <strong>31 km (1466m D+)<\/strong>, <strong>17 km (924m D+)<\/strong>, <strong>15 km<\/strong>, <strong>Caminhada de 12 km<\/strong> e o <strong>GTSA Kids<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">2 a 4 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 22:00<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px s